From 82afdda237bdad746ad9228225219a5f2d3721f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:34:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Native Windows build with Visual Studio (clang-cl) + CMake +
 vcpkg

Adds CMakeLists.txt, CMakePresets.json, vcpkg.json and build-msvc.bat so the
client builds on Windows without MSYS2. The crash handler uses DbgHelp
instead of dwarfstack when built with the Microsoft toolchain.
---
